# Source audio stays local; only the encoded track the app ships is committed.
#
# The 11MB 256kbps MP3 from Pixabay is the master copy. What gets deployed is a
# 128kbps AAC re-encode at roughly half the size — see README.md in this folder.
*.mp3
*.wav
*.ogg
*.m4a

# ...except the track the app actually plays, which has to reach the deploy.
!flute.m4a
!rain.m4a
